@baseUrl = https://localhost:7150
@session = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_OPERATOR_SESSION
@csrf = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_CSRF_PROOF
@version = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@operation = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222

### Requires configured test-chat scope, current operator grant and recent MFA
GET {{baseUrl}}/management/v1/admin/sli-reports?scopeId=test-chat&limit=20
Cookie: __Host-uzllm-session={{session}}

### Summary; a random version returns 404, never customer telemetry
GET {{baseUrl}}/management/v1/admin/sli-reports/{{version}}
Cookie: __Host-uzllm-session={{session}}

### Frozen manifest membership
GET {{baseUrl}}/management/v1/admin/sli-reports/{{version}}/sources?limit=50
Cookie: __Host-uzllm-session={{session}}

### Classified executions, not provider payloads
GET {{baseUrl}}/management/v1/admin/sli-reports/{{version}}/executions?limit=50
Cookie: __Host-uzllm-session={{session}}

### Closed UTC month; reusing the UUID requires identical normalized terms
POST {{baseUrl}}/management/v1/admin/sli-reports
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: __Host-uzllm-session={{session}}; __Host-uzllm-csrf={{csrf}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"scopeId":"test-chat","periodStart":"2026-09-01T00:00:00Z","idempotencyKey":"33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333","expectedGeneration":0,"reason":"Monthly operational evidence"}

### Explicit revision, original version stays immutable
POST {{baseUrl}}/management/v1/admin/sli-reports/{{version}}/revisions
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: __Host-uzllm-session={{session}}; __Host-uzllm-csrf={{csrf}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"idempotencyKey":"44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444","expectedGeneration":1,"reason":"Late terminal evidence reconciled"}

### Pending/Failed/Published and independent lease/dead-letter metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/management/v1/admin/sli-reports/jobs/{{operation}}
Cookie: __Host-uzllm-session={{session}}
